---
// Distributed T+1 Reconciliation Batch Pipeline Diagram Component
---

<figure class="rcp-diag" aria-labelledby="rcp-diag-caption">
  <!-- Desktop SVG Layout -->
  <svg
    class="rcp-diag__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 880 340"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="rcp-diag-title rcp-diag-desc"
  >
    <title id="rcp-diag-title">分散式 T+1 批次對帳引擎處理管線圖</title>
    <desc id="rcp-diag-desc">
      展示銀行對帳單下載經 Parser Worker 轉換為統一 Parquet 格式，交由
      Spark/DuckDB 引擎進行精確匹配，輸出平帳歸檔或差錯帳佇列。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="rcp-arrow-blue"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="rcp-diag__arrow-head--blue"
        ></path>
      </marker>
      <marker
        id="rcp-arrow-purple"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="rcp-diag__arrow-head--purple"
        ></path>
      </marker>
      <marker
        id="rcp-arrow-green"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="rcp-diag__arrow-head--green"
        ></path>
      </marker>
      <marker
        id="rcp-arrow-red"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="rcp-diag__arrow-head--red"
        ></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Outer Card Background -->
    <rect
      x="25"
      y="15"
      width="830"
      height="310"
      rx="12"
      class="rcp-diag__card-bg"></rect>

    <!-- Step 1: Ingestion SFTP / S3 (x: 270, width: 340) -->
    <g transform="translate(270, 30)">
      <rect
        width="340"
        height="42"
        rx="8"
        class="rcp-diag__box rcp-diag__box--blue"></rect>
      <text
        x="170"
        y="26"
        class="rcp-diag__title rcp-diag__title--blue"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        1. 銀行對帳單自動抓取 (SFTP / S3 Bucket)
      </text>
    </g>

    <path
      d="M 440 72 L 440 105"
      class="rcp-diag__path rcp-diag__path--blue"
      marker-end="url(#rcp-arrow-blue)"></path>

    <!-- Step 2: Parser Workers (x: 180, width: 520) -->
    <g transform="translate(180, 105)">
      <rect
        width="520"
        height="42"
        rx="8"
        class="rcp-diag__box rcp-diag__box--blue"></rect>
      <text
        x="260"
        y="26"
        class="rcp-diag__title rcp-diag__title--blue"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        2. 格式化解析 Worker (CSV / MT940 / Camt.053 ➔ 統一 Parquet 列式儲存)
      </text>
    </g>

    <path
      d="M 440 147 L 440 180"
      class="rcp-diag__path rcp-diag__path--purple"
      marker-end="url(#rcp-arrow-purple)"></path>

    <!-- Step 3: Spark / DuckDB Core Engine (x: 50, width: 780) -->
    <g transform="translate(50, 180)">
      <rect
        width="780"
        height="65"
        rx="8"
        class="rcp-diag__box rcp-diag__box--purple"></rect>
      <text
        x="390"
        y="26"
        class="rcp-diag__title rcp-diag__title--purple"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        3. 【 分散式對帳核心引擎 (Apache Spark / DuckDB SQL Engine) 】
      </text>
      <text x="390" y="48" class="rcp-diag__desc" text-anchor="middle">
        基於 Idempotency Key 進行 FULL OUTER JOIN ｜
        自動比對金額、幣別、手續費與授權時間差
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- Diverging Arrows to Results -->
    <path
      d="M 240 245 L 240 275"
      class="rcp-diag__path rcp-diag__path--green"
      marker-end="url(#rcp-arrow-green)"></path>
    <path
      d="M 640 245 L 640 275"
      class="rcp-diag__path rcp-diag__path--red"
      marker-end="url(#rcp-arrow-red)"></path>

    <!-- Result 1: Reconciled (x: 50, width: 380) -->
    <g transform="translate(50, 275)">
      <rect
        width="380"
        height="38"
        rx="6"
        class="rcp-diag__box rcp-diag__box--green"></rect>
      <text
        x="190"
        y="24"
        class="rcp-diag__res-title rcp-diag__res-title--green"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        ✅ 平帳 (Reconciled) ➔ 進入自動結帳歸檔
      </text>
    </g>

    <!-- Result 2: Discrepancy (x: 450, width: 380) -->
    <g transform="translate(450, 275)">
      <rect
        width="380"
        height="38"
        rx="6"
        class="rcp-diag__box rcp-diag__box--red"></rect>
      <text
        x="190"
        y="24"
        class="rcp-diag__res-title rcp-diag__res-title--red"
        text-anchor="middle"
      >
        ❌ 差錯帳 (Discrepancy) ➔ 寫入自動補償修復佇列
      </text>
    </g>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile View (Vertical Cards) -->
  <div class="rcp-diag__mobile">
    <div class="rcp-mobile-card rcp-mobile-card--blue">
      <span class="rcp-mobile-badge rcp-mobile-badge--blue"
        >STEP 1: 檔案接收</span
      >
      <h4>1. 對帳單自動排程抓取</h4>
      <p>夜間定時透過 SFTP 或雲端 S3 Bucket 下載各銀行收單行之清算原始日誌。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="rcp-mobile-card rcp-mobile-card--blue">
      <span class="rcp-mobile-badge rcp-mobile-badge--blue"
        >STEP 2: 格式清洗</span
      >
      <h4>2. 格式化解析 Workers</h4>
      <p>
        將異構格式（CSV、自定義定長格式、SWIFT MT940、ISO 20022
        Camt.053）清洗為統一 Schema 之 Parquet 列式資料。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="rcp-mobile-card rcp-mobile-card--purple">
      <span class="rcp-mobile-badge rcp-mobile-badge--purple"
        >STEP 3: 匹配運算</span
      >
      <h4>3. 分散式運算引擎 (Spark / DuckDB)</h4>
      <p>
        針對數千萬筆明細，以冪等鍵、金額、幣別執行分佈式 JOIN
        比對，極大化降低百萬級帳目稽核耗時至數分鐘。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="rcp-mobile-card rcp-mobile-card--green">
      <span class="rcp-mobile-badge rcp-mobile-badge--green">MATCHED</span>
      <h4>4A. 平帳 (Reconciled)</h4>
      <p>兩造記錄金額與狀態完全一致，自動歸檔進入會計結帳結案流程。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="rcp-mobile-card rcp-mobile-card--red">
      <span class="rcp-mobile-badge rcp-mobile-badge--red">DISCREPANCY</span>
      <h4>4B. 差錯帳 (Discrepancy)</h4>
      <p>
        識別「單邊帳」、「金額不符」或「狀態逾時」，投遞至差錯帳佇列觸發自動調帳沖正或人工審批工單。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="rcp-diag-caption" class="rcp-diag__caption">
    圖三：分散式 T+1 批次對帳引擎處理管線與平帳/差錯帳分流機制
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .rcp-diag {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .rcp-diag__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .rcp-diag__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  .rcp-diag__caption {
    margin-top: 0.875rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--dg-muted, #8b949e);
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  /* SVG Theme Token Styles */
  .rcp-diag__card-bg {
    fill: var(--dg-surface, #161b22);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule, #30363d);
    stroke-width: 1.5px;
  }

  .rcp-diag__box {
    stroke-width: 1.5px;
  }

  .rcp-diag__box--blue {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2, #1f242c);
    stroke: #388bfd;
  }

  .rcp-diag__box--purple {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2, #241b35);
    stroke: #bc8cff;
  }

  .rcp-diag__box--green {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2, #1b2e23);
    stroke: #238636;
  }

  .rcp-diag__box--red {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2, #2d1d24);
    stroke: #da3633;
  }

  .rcp-diag__title {
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .rcp-diag__title--blue {
    fill: #58a6ff;
  }

  .rcp-diag__title--purple {
    fill: #d2a8ff;
  }

  .rcp-diag__desc {
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    fill: var(--dg-ink-2, #8b949e);
  }

  .rcp-diag__res-title {
    font-family:
      system-ui,
      -apple-system,
      sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .rcp-diag__res-title--green {
    fill: #3fb950;
  }

  .rcp-diag__res-title--red {
    fill: #f85149;
  }

  .rcp-diag__path {
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2px;
  }

  .rcp-diag__path--blue {
    stroke: #388bfd;
  }

  .rcp-diag__path--purple {
    stroke: #bc8cff;
  }

  .rcp-diag__path--green {
    stroke: #238636;
  }

  .rcp-diag__path--red {
    stroke: #da3633;
  }

  .rcp-diag__arrow-head--blue {
    fill: #388bfd;
  }

  .rcp-diag__arrow-head--purple {
    fill: #bc8cff;
  }

  .rcp-diag__arrow-head--green {
    fill: #238636;
  }

  .rcp-diag__arrow-head--red {
    fill: #da3633;
  }

  /* Light Theme Adjustments */
  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rcp-diag__card-bg {
    fill: var(--dg-surface, #ffffff);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule, #d0d7de);
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rcp-diag__box--blue {
    fill: #eff7ff;
    stroke: #0969da;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rcp-diag__box--purple {
    fill: #fbefff;
    stroke: #8250df;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rcp-diag__box--green {
    fill: #dafbe1;
    stroke: #1a7f37;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rcp-diag__box--red {
    fill: #ffebe9;
    stroke: #cf222e;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rcp-diag__title--blue {
    fill: #0969da;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rcp-diag__title--purple {
    fill: #8250df;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rcp-diag__res-title--green {
    fill: #1a7f37;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rcp-diag__res-title--red {
    fill: #cf222e;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rcp-diag__path--blue {
    stroke: #0969da;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rcp-diag__path--purple {
    stroke: #8250df;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rcp-diag__path--green {
    stroke: #1a7f37;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rcp-diag__path--red {
    stroke: #cf222e;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rcp-diag__arrow-head--blue {
    fill: #0969da;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rcp-diag__arrow-head--purple {
    fill: #8250df;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rcp-diag__arrow-head--green {
    fill: #1a7f37;
  }

  :global(:root:not([data-theme="dark"])) .rcp-diag__arrow-head--red {
    fill: #cf222e;
  }

  /* Mobile Responsive View */
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .rcp-diag__desktop {
      display: none !important;
    }

    .rcp-diag__mobile {
      display: flex !important;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.875rem;
    }

    .rcp-mobile-card {
      padding: 1rem 1.125rem;
      border-radius: 0.5rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--dg-rule, #30363d);
      background: var(--dg-surface, #161b22);
    }

    .rcp-mobile-card--blue {
      border-color: #388bfd;
      background: rgba(56, 139, 253, 0.05);
    }

    .rcp-mobile-card--purple {
      border-color: #bc8cff;
      background: rgba(188, 140, 255, 0.05);
    }

    .rcp-mobile-card--green {
      border-color: #238636;
      background: rgba(35, 134, 54, 0.05);
    }

    .rcp-mobile-card--red {
      border-color: #da3633;
      background: rgba(218, 54, 51, 0.05);
    }

    .rcp-mobile-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.125rem 0.4rem;
      border-radius: 0.25rem;
      font-size: 0.6875rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      margin-bottom: 0.375rem;
    }

    .rcp-mobile-badge--blue {
      background: rgba(56, 139, 253, 0.2);
      color: #58a6ff;
    }

    .rcp-mobile-badge--purple {
      background: rgba(188, 140, 255, 0.2);
      color: #d2a8ff;
    }

    .rcp-mobile-badge--green {
      background: rgba(35, 134, 54, 0.2);
      color: #3fb950;
    }

    .rcp-mobile-badge--red {
      background: rgba(218, 54, 51, 0.2);
      color: #f85149;
    }

    .rcp-mobile-card h4 {
      margin: 0 0 0.375rem;
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-ink, #f0f6fc);
    }

    .rcp-mobile-card p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: var(--dg-ink-2, #8b949e);
    }
  }
</style>
